<title>JAPAN: Mazda sees dlr test 130 yen, below 120 by year-end.</title>
<headline>Mazda sees dlr test 130 yen, below 120 by year-end.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mazda Motor Corp president Henry Wallace said on Thursday he thinks the dollar may test 130 yen in the short term but it could go back below 120 yen towards the end of the year.</p>
</text>
